{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048","id":788924297,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3ODg5MjQyOTc=","number":5048,"title":"Fatal error during initial scan in Lumen","user":{"login":"mabasic","id":1839930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4Mzk5MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1839930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic","html_url":"https://github.com/mabasic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabasic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":486061586,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0ODYwNjE1ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ee0701","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2021-01-19T11:01:17Z","updated_at":"2021-01-19T22:54:30Z","closed_at":"2021-01-19T22:21:34Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Because `laravel/lumen-framework` is requiring `illuminate/queue` which has a class `CallQueuedClosure` which uses a trait `Illuminate\\Foundation\\Bus\\Dispatchable` which is only available in `illuminate/foundation` which is not required in `laravel/lumen-framework` we get the error bellow when running `./vendor/bin/psalm --init`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nCalculating best config level based on project files\r\nCalculating best config level based on project files\r\nScanning files...\r\nPHP Fatal error:  Trait 'Illuminate\\Foundation\\Bus\\Dispatchable' not found in /.../blog/vendor/illuminate/queue/CallQueuedClosure.php on line 14\r\nFatal error: Trait 'Illuminate\\Foundation\\Bus\\Dispatchable' not found in /.../blog/vendor/illuminate/queue/CallQueuedClosure.php on line 14\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere is a PR/Issue on `laravel/framework` with more info on this: https://github.com/laravel/framework/pull/35399\r\n\r\nTo get the initial scan to complete I had to manually remove that missing trait from `CallQueuedClosed`, run the command `psalm --init` and then restore the file `CallQueuedClosed.php` as it was.\r\n\r\nAny ideas on how can this be solved so that it does not throw a fatal error on initial run?\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/5048/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}